---
layout: base.njk
title: Blog
description: "Thoughts on building energy research, academic life, and decarbonization policy from Dr. Carolina Recart."
---
{# =========================================================================
   BLOG LISTING PAGE (src/blog/index.njk)
   Shows all posts from src/blog/posts/*.md, newest first.

   HOW TO ADD A NEW BLOG POST:
   1. Create a new file in src/blog/posts/ — name it something like
      2025-06-my-post-title.md
   2. Add front matter at the top of the file:
      ---
      title: "My Post Title"
      date: 2025-06-01
      description: "A short one-sentence summary shown in the listing."
      tags:
        - research
        - retrofit
      ---
   3. Write your post content below the second --- in Markdown
   4. Save — the listing page updates automatically on next build

   TAGS: Add any tags you like. They appear as small badges on each post card.
   ========================================================================= #}

<header class="page-header">
  <div class="page-header-inner">
    <h1>Blog</h1>
    <p>{{ blog.description }}</p>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="blog-listing">

  {% if collections.posts and collections.posts.length %}

    {% for post in collections.posts %}
    <article class="post-card">

      <div class="post-card-meta">
        <time datetime="{{ post.date | htmlDateString }}">
          {{ post.date | readableDate }}
        </time>
        {% if post.data.tags %}
          {% for tag in post.data.tags %}
            {% if tag != "posts" %}
            <span class="tag">{{ tag }}</span>
            {% endif %}
          {% endfor %}
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      <h2>
        <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
      </h2>

      {% if post.data.description %}
      <p class="excerpt">{{ post.data.description }}</p>
      {% endif %}

      <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="btn btn--sm btn--outline">Read more &rarr;</a>

    </article>
    {% endfor %}

  {% else %}

    <div class="empty-state">
      <p>No posts yet.</p>
      <p style="margin-top: var(--space-4); font-size: var(--text-sm);">
        To add your first post, create a Markdown file in <code>src/blog/posts/</code>
        with front matter: <code>title</code>, <code>date</code>, and <code>description</code>.
      </p>
    </div>

  {% endif %}

</div>
